      "snippet": {
        "line": 954,
        "text": "derivativeCoefficient d eta = d.core.lam * ((1/2 - d.h) + geometricSource d eta) * (1 - d.core.lam) / (decay d.core ^ 2 * equilibriumNumerator d eta), with equilibriumNumerator d eta = d.core.lam - d.h + geometricSource d eta"
      }
